    "turn_text": "Mr. Chairman, your work on passing this farm bill is finished with the signature of the president anticipated before this interview is posted. Have you thought about implementation and what role your committee will take in assuring that the hard fought compromises will be fairly executed by the U.S. Department of Agriculture?",
